is </span><span begin="00:08.709" end="00:09.092">this </span><span begin="00:09.092" end="00:09.517">a </span><span begin="00:09.517" end="00:09.981">trick?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.404" end="00:13.701"><span begin="00:10.404" end="00:10.782">I'm </span><span begin="00:10.782" end="00:11.205">not </span><span begin="00:11.205" end="00:11.654">sure </span><span begin="00:11.654" end="00:12.157">but </span><span begin="00:12.157" end="00:12.525">I </span><span begin="00:12.525" end="00:12.964">will </span><span begin="00:12.964" end="00:13.398">stick </span><span begin="00:13.398" end="00:13.701">with</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.773" end="00:23.252"><span begin="00:20.773" end="00:21.053">Light </span><span begin="00:21.053" end="00:21.477">blue </span><span begin="00:21.477" end="00:21.856">eyes </span><span begin="00:21.856" end="00:22.338">didn't </span><span begin="00:22.338" end="00:22.720">show </span><span begin="00:22.720" end="00:23.252">surprise</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.500" end="00:26.836"><span begin="00:23.500" end="00:23.684">When </span><span begin="00:23.684" end="00:24.044">I </span><span begin="00:24.044" end="00:24.458">explained </span><span begin="00:24.458" end="00:24.673">the </span><span begin="00:24.673" end="00:25.145">fact </span><span begin="00:25.145" end="00:25.353">that </span><span begin="00:25.353" end="00:25.787">I'm </span><span begin="00:26.010" end="00:26.836">satisfied</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.059" end="00:30.641"><span begin="00:27.059" end="00:27.435">The </span><span begin="00:27.435" end="00:28.523">butterflies </span><span begin="00:28.784" end="00:29.216">move </span><span begin="00:29.216" end="00:29.533">in </span><span begin="00:29.533" end="00:29.989">my </span><span begin="00:29.989" end="00:30.641">tummy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.870" end="00:33.967"><span begin="00:30.870" end="00:31.325">Float </span><span begin="00:31.325" end="00:31.928">around </span><span begin="00:31.928" end="00:32.163">and </span><span begin="00:32.163" end="00:32.379">make </span><span begin="00:32.379" end="00:32.667">me </span><span begin="00:32.667" end="00:32.837">feel </span><span begin="00:32.837" end="00:33.239">really </span><span begin="00:33.239" end="00:33.967">funny</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.327" end="00:37.332"><span begin="00:34.327" end="00:34.506">You </span><span begin="00:34.506" end="00:35.630">disagree </span><span begin="00:35.630" end="00:35.862">with </span><span begin="00:35.862" end="00:36.229">my </span><span begin="00:36.229" end="00:36.613">self-</span><span begin="00:36.613" end="00:37.332">esteem</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.707" end="00:40.863"><span begin="00:37.707" end="00:37.948">Did </span><span begin="00:37.948" end="00:38.179">I </span><span begin="00:38.179" end="00:39.051">mention </span><span begin="00:39.051" end="00:39.300">you </span><span begin="00:39.300" end="00:39.455">were </span><span begin="00:39.455" end="00:39.887">in </span><span begin="00:39.887" end="00:40.311">my </span><span begin="00:40.311" end="00:40.863">dreams?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.191" end="00:44.209"><span begin="00:41.191" end="00:41.599">We </span><span begin="00:41.599" end="00:42.039">could </span><span begin="00:42.039" end="00:42.479">walk </span><span begin="00:42.479" end="00:42.767">on </span><span begin="00:42.767" end="00:42.935">the </span><span begin="00:42.935" end="00:44.209">ceiling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.209" end="00:53.021"><span begin="00:44.209" end="00:44.633">And </span><span begin="00:44.633" end="00:45.041">we </span><span begin="00:45.041" end="00:45.357">thought </span><span begin="00:45.357" end="00:45.781">that </span><span begin="00:46.285" end="00:46.974">nothing </span><span begin="00:46.974" end="00:47.381">would </span><span begin="00:47.381" end="00:48.013">go </span><span begin="00:48.013" end="00:53.021">wrong</spa